      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>entityBasePackages</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>entityBasePackageClasses</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> containing all discovered entity classes.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassNotFoundException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">ClassNotFoundException</a></code> - if a discovered class could not be loaded via.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>entityBasePackages</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>entityBasePackageClasses</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>包含所有发现的实体类的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Set</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassNotFoundException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">ClassNotFoundException</a></code> - 如果无法通过加载器加载发现的某个类。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
